{
  "title": "武胜路429弄北门横架上的四枚字牌",
  "decision": "The same four gilt signs form a shallow arch in the 2017, 2020 and 2021 Wusheng Road street views. The lettering reads 重新小区. The 2017 green address plaque shows 429弄. The differently signed gate on Chongqing North Road is approximately 142.46 m away. Only the Wusheng Road entrance is represented here.",
  "method": "The 2017 and 2020 sign disks were independently sampled on the spherical panoramas. The 2021 frontal gate survey sets the nominal 3.05 m opening width. Robust multi-camera fits on a single plane produced the four centers and individual radii. The 2020 gilt contrast and registered 2017 stroke contrast were combined to extract the editable polygons. Specular arcs on the black rims were excluded. Thin lettering depth and physical size are estimated.",
